Yes, you can use the following CSS to create a glass effect for a component:

```
/* Add these styles to your stylesheet */
.glass {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

/* Apply these styles to your component */
.my-component {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  border: none;
  margin: 20px auto;
  padding: 10px;
}
